{
  "version": 1,
  "fps": 30,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "In the shadowy corners,where the cobwebs weave,",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 6,
      "endFrame": 200
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Lives the Boogeyman,so they believe.",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 203,
      "endFrame": 393
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Under beds,in closets,just out of sight,",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 396,
      "endFrame": 593
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "He lurks in the darkness,keeping away the light.",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 596,
      "endFrame": 788
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "No face to see,he changes his look,",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 791,
      "endFrame": 988
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "From a shadowy figure to the monster in your book.",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 991,
      "endFrame": 1186
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "In every home,he's a different shade,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1189,
      "endFrame": 1384
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Crafted by the fears that night has made.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1387,
      "endFrame": 1582
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Boogeyman,Boogeyman,hidden so grand,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1585,
      "endFrame": 1780
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Teaching lessons across every land.",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1783,
      "endFrame": 1977
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Eat your veggies,say your prayers,",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1980,
      "endFrame": 2173
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Or the Boogeyman will catch you unawares.",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2176,
      "endFrame": 2356
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Some nights he's tall,some days he's small,",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2359,
      "endFrame": 2553
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Sometimes he's not even scary at all.",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2556,
      "endFrame": 2755
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "But one thing's consistent,his mysterious plan,",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2758,
      "endFrame": 2951
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "To sneak into dreams,as only a Boogeyman can.",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2954,
      "endFrame": 3146
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "He's there to remind,with a nudge or a fright,",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3149,
      "endFrame": 3337
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "To brush your teeth and say goodnight.",
      "section": "section_4",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3340,
      "endFrame": 3532
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Parents whisper,children heed,",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3535,
      "endFrame": 3731
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "The Boogeyman's watching,so do good deeds.",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3734,
      "endFrame": 3927
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Boogeyman,Boogeyman,hidden so grand,",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3930,
      "endFrame": 4116
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Teaching lessons across every land.",
      "section": "section_6",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4119,
      "endFrame": 4310
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Clean your room,don't you whine,",
      "section": "section_6",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4313,
      "endFrame": 4514
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Or the Boogeyman will come at bedtime",
      "section": "section_6",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4517,
      "endFrame": 4714
    }
  ],
